title:    Route restored, and Private Google Access comes back
subtitle: The control was degraded on purpose, and put back the same way
width:    980
---
route restored: Private Google Access -> 401   PSC endpoint -> 401

# Proof that the failure in the previous card was caused by the route and by
# nothing else. A measurement that breaks something and cannot restore it has
# not isolated a cause; it has just broken something.
#
# The route is recreated in a trap that runs on every exit path of
# scripts/break-pga.sh, including Ctrl-C and an exception.
